        "Specify contact list names in Apollo where enriched leads should be exported.",
        "Save settings. Typpout will now automatically query Apollo when new social intent is detected."
      ]
    },
    intercom: {
      steps: [
        "In your Typpout dashboard, click on **Integrations > Intercom**.",
        "Click **Connect Intercom** to open the Intercom App Store authorization screen.",
        "Approve Typpout's request to read/write conversations and contact profiles.",
        "Select which SDR agent in Intercom should receive routing assignments.",
        "Configure live intent signals to automatically trigger custom inbound messenger cards."
      ]
    },
    stripe: {
      steps: [
        "In your Stripe Dashboard, go to **Developers > API keys** and copy a restricted key with write access to Webhooks.",
